# Runtime state. Every lab rebuilds these on first request; committing them
# would ship one learner's progress to everyone else.
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal
*.db

# Per-learner state written by the labs that model a stateful application.
*/state/*
!*/state/.gitignore
*/pastes/*
!*/pastes/.gitignore
*/data/*
!*/data/.gitignore

# Uploaded web shells and the files the labs write while being exploited.
*/uploads/*/*
!*/uploads/*/.gitkeep
*_flag.txt
*.log

# The RSA keypair under "JWT Lab/keys/" is NOT ignored and is committed on
# purpose: it is the issuer key the RS256 levels verify against, and levels 5
# and 8 depend on the public half being public. It is a lab artefact, not a
# secret. Everything in this repository is intentionally vulnerable.
